"以授予您参加监考考试的权限。入职资料审核可能需要 2 个以上工作日。\n"
"    "

#: templates/onboarding_exam/submitted.html:36
msgid ""
"\n"
"      If you have made an error in this submission you may restart the onboarding process. \n"
